# INVALIDS: all the test here shouldn´t go past and execute any commands.
# After every Ultralite call ?Period: Should still be 10.

# ---- C1: index 0 reservado (set 0x80)
# : 80 04 00 00 00 05
0.0|=Period 10
# expect: ACK: done
2.0|=Ultralite 8004000000050000000000000000000000000001
# expect: ACK: done
4.0|?Period
# expect: ACK: 10

# ---- C2: Query unknown (query index 3)
# : 03
6.0|=Period 10
# expect: ACK: done
8.0|=Ultralite 0300000000000000000000000000000000000001
# expect: ACK: done
10.0|?Period
# expect: ACK: 10

